OL,3,GNEWSAHopes for 'awesome' Pride despite
OL,4,Aferry problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FChannel Islands Pride organisers have
OL,7,Finsisted this year's event will be
OL,8,F"awesome" despite the setback of a
OL,9,Fcancelled inter-island ferry service.
OL,11,FIslands Unlimited, which runs a daily
OL,12,Finter-island foot passenger service,
OL,13,Fhas ended the season early due to an
OL,14,Fengine failure on its MV San Pawl
OL,15,Fvessel.
OL,17,FChannel Islands Pride is due to take
OL,18,Fplace from Friday to Sunday with the
OL,19,Fmain village area at La Vallette
OL,20,FBathing Pools in St Peter Port,
OL,21,FGuernsey.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
