OL,3,GNEWSAHopes for 'awesome' Pride despite
OL,4,Aferry problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FEllie Jones, Pride director and chief
OL,7,Fexecutive of LGBTQ+ charity Liberate,
OL,8,Fsaid the "disappointing" situation
OL,9,Fwould impact about 100 day trippers
OL,10,Fthat she knew of - but added Islands
OL,11,FUnlimited "couldn't have done anything
OL,12,Fmore".
